summary = "Your Marshal suggests fortifying a key mountain pass on your border."
description = "Your Marshal points to a narrow, winding pass through the mountains that marks your border. \"This pass is our greatest defensive asset, my Liege,\" he states. \"An invading army would be forced to march through it. If we were to build a fortified outpost here, a handful of our men could hold off an army ten times their size.\""
